# 1. surface
c('surface', 'The public docs index (llms.txt) lists 307 pages across: assistants, squads, GPT-Live (beta), Composer (alpha), tools (API request, function, transfer, handoff, voicemail, DTMF, SMS, knowledge-base query, MCP, Google Calendar/Sheets, Slack, GoHighLevel, Make, n8n), phone numbers and SIP (Twilio, Telnyx, Vonage, DIDWW, Plivo, Zadarma, Bitcall, didlogic, Amazon Chime), campaigns, chat/SMS/web widget, server webhooks, evals, simulations, boards, structured outputs, scorecards, monitoring, logs, billing, security/compliance, CLI, MCP server, agent skills and GitOps config-as-code.', 'observed', T + 'docs/docs.vapi.ai_llms.txt', 'https://docs.vapi.ai/llms.txt')
c('surface', 'There is no contact/CRM object: the public API has no /contact or /customer endpoint; a customer is an inline object (number, name, email, externalId, sipUri, extension) on each call or campaign row. Consent, suppression, opt-out and contact history live in the buyer\'s own system.', 'observed', T + 'openapi/api.vapi.ai_api-json (paths; schema CreateCustomerDTO)', 'https://api.vapi.ai/api-json')
c('surface', 'Campaigns: up to 10,000 contacts per campaign (CSV <=5 MB, lowercase `number` header required, other columns become variables), maxConcurrency default 10 / max 500 within the subscription limit, optional blocking pre-dial eligibility webhook, multi-number dialPlan. No draft state: a campaign launches or schedules on creation, is read-only afterwards, can only be cancelled, archived or duplicated. Confirms and extends l4a parity.csv outbound_campaigns/Vapi.', 'observed', T + 'docs-md/outbound-campaigns__contact-data.md', T + 'docs-md/outbound-campaigns__scheduling-and-lifecycle.md', T + 'openapi/api.vapi.ai_api-json (Campaign, CreateCampaignDTO)', L + 'l4a-competitors/parity.csv')
c('surface', 'The dashboard Campaigns UI is new: the changelog announces "You can now create and run outbound calling campaigns from the dashboard" in the week of 2026-08-31; per-contact tracking is newer still (UI string: "It was created before per-contact tracking existed").', 'observed', T + 'changelog/entries/2026-8-31.md', R + 'bundle-findings.json (campaign_wizard_strings)')
c('surface', 'Chat/copilot builders ship: Composer (alpha, in-dashboard assistant that creates assistants, numbers, integrations, troubleshoots; cannot delete, test, or reach external systems), a Composer-based onboarding flow rolling out from 2026-05-18, an Agent Builder page ("describe what you want" plus templates incl. "Build a bilingual receptionist"), and Simulations inside Composer (2026-09-14).', 'observed', T + 'docs-md/composer.md', T + 'changelog/entries/2026-5-18.md', T + 'changelog/entries/2026-9-14.md', T + 'dashboard-js-lazy/js__AgentBuilderPage-BQ6Au6GN.js')
c('surface', 'Flag-gated, unannounced surfaces in the dashboard code: "Mission Control" (alpha; use-case cards with sentiment trend, issue markers, live call listening and live call control such as "Ask agent to respond now"), "Call Health" issue scans (e.g. "Latency over N seconds"), an "Improve the assistant" Composer kickoff, enterprise audio-processing and call-analysis pages, and flags enable-full-duplex-harness / enable-multi-harness.', 'observed', R + 'bundle-findings.json (dashboard_routes, feature_flags)', T + 'dashboard-js-lazy/js__CallHealthIssuePage-BmzvjsqJ.js', T + 'dashboard-js-lazy/js__agentImprovementKickoff-DsRJ9i6J.js')
c('surface', 'Team roles and governance by tier: Usage-only and Core make every member an admin; Pro has basic RBAC; custom RBAC and SSO are Premier only; an audit-logs page and roles-permissions route exist in the dashboard. Raw data retention 14 / 30 / 180 days / custom.', 'observed', T + 'docs-md/billing__pricing-and-success-packages.md', R + 'bundle-findings.json (dashboard_routes)')
